# Pairs with PublishedPinWithinPersistedBelief, and reproduces issue #3476: the
# pin resolves min(current, covered), where current includes the pending
# advance, so once coverage has been stamped over the pending checkpoint the pin
# store receives an offset the leaf has not persisted - and can never lower it.
MODULE: PublishedPinWithinPersistedBeliefPublishesPending
TARGET: PublishedPinWithinPersistedBelief
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the published pin is bounded by the pending checkpoint rather than the persisted one
PERTURBS: PublishPin

--- FIND
    /\ LET safe == IF stCp[l] < cov[l] THEN stCp[l] ELSE cov[l]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the pending checkpoint reaches the pin.
    /\ LET safe == IF Cur(l) < cov[l] THEN Cur(l) ELSE cov[l]
--- END